  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pricepally&#xa0;- an innovative online grocery&#xa0;platform that uses technology,&#xa0;data, and partnerships to make affordable and nutritious food accessible while&#xa0;reducing food waste and creating a resilient food system.&#xa0;&#x200b;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will focus on:
Enhancing the existing consumer app by&#xa0;leveraging gamification to boost customer acquisition and demand.
enhancing the operational app to streamline the supply processes,&#xa0;leverage demand data sharing with farmers and producers to enhance production planning&#xa0; and minimize distribution challenges that result in post harvest losses.
Developing an integrated inventory management for wholesalers, effectively addressing inventory issues, overstocking, understocking, and thereby minimizing food losses.&#x200b;</narrative>
  </description>
